      "spam": false,
      "value": "This is a really, really, good idea.\n\nI'd love it if it was like say, 8 buttons that don't show up unless the world has a vrc_trigger with just like OnInteract, it had OnMenuInteract, with a field 'Text: ' that you could write something, and that text is what appeared on the menu item, and 'Slot number' would determine which slot the OnMenuInteract would be on. Even if it was restricted to only ever be LocalOnly broadcast, it would still be super super useful.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
